# U22: undo/redo. With the edit focused, Ctrl+Z runs twice (NotesTab:Draw's loop, then the
# edit's own OnKeyDown through ProcessControlsInput); after a button click took the focus away
# only NotesTab's loop undoes. Ctrl+Y likewise. Also the zoom keys (Ctrl+- / Ctrl+0,
# allowZoom), BACK, DELETE and a snapshot of the unsaved state (modFlag on, the title's
# unsaved mark).
#! u22-expect-notes ne two thr
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
frames 2
move 400 91
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
press RETURN
frames 3
key-down CTRL
press 6
key-up CTRL
frames 2
type "one"
type " two"
type " three"
press BACK
press BACK
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press z
key-up CTRL
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press y
key-up CTRL
frames 2
# focus away (NORMAL inserts ^xC8C8C8), then undo from the tab's loop only
move 370 97
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
move 700 450
key-down CTRL
press z
frames 1
press z
frames 1
press y
key-up CTRL
frames 2
# back into the edit: zoom out and reset
move 600 300
click LEFTBUTTON
key-down CTRL
press -
frames 1
press -
frames 2
press 0
key-up CTRL
frames 2
press HOME
press DELETE
frames 2
snapshot unsaved
frames 1
